<!-- ───────────── Start here · 3-stage carousel ───────────── -->
<section id="primer" class="primer-section">
  <div class="primer-carousel" id="primer-carousel">
    <div class="primer-stage-nav">
      <div class="primer-stage-label">
        <span style="color: var(--yellow); font-size: 18px;">★</span>
        <span class="primer-stage-pos" id="primer-pos">1 of 3</span>
        <span id="primer-stage-title">Insurance Brokerage Primer</span>
      </div>
      <div class="primer-stage-controls">
        <button class="primer-arrow" id="primer-prev" aria-label="Previous stage" type="button">←</button>
        <div class="primer-dots" role="tablist" aria-label="Start here stages">
          <button class="primer-dot-btn" data-stage="0" aria-current="true" aria-label="Stage 1: Insurance Brokerage Primer" type="button"></button>
          <button class="primer-dot-btn" data-stage="1" aria-label="Stage 2: Retirement &amp; Wealth Primer" type="button"></button>
          <button class="primer-dot-btn" data-stage="2" aria-label="Stage 3: Customer HUB International Primer" type="button"></button>
        </div>
        <button class="primer-arrow" id="primer-next" aria-label="Next stage" type="button">→</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="primer-stages-viewport">
      <div class="primer-stages-track" id="primer-track">

        <!-- ── Stage 1: Insurance Brokerage Primer ── -->
        <div class="primer-stage" data-stage-title="Insurance Brokerage Primer">
          <div class="primer-inner">
            <div class="primer-content">
              <div class="section-eyebrow primer-eyebrow"><span style="color: var(--yellow);">★</span> Stage 1 · Industry foundation</div>
              <h2>Insurance Brokerage <span class="accent">Primer</span></h2>
              <p class="section-lede">Built from a 6-hour knowledge-transfer session with industry SME Jim B. The 200-carrier reconciliation reality, the producer-loyalty problem, the commission math, the wholesale (GA) layer, COBRA quirks, and the M&amp;A pressure that funds the buying decision — with verbatim quotes from the transcript.</p>
              <p style="color: var(--slate); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65; margin-bottom: 32px;">If you've never sold insurance brokerage software, read this <em>before</em> everything else in the pack. The product, the customer pains, the demo moments — they only land once the industry context is in place.</p>
              <div class="primer-actions">
                <a class="btn btn-primary primer-btn" href="08-industry-primer.html">Open the primer →</a>
                <a class="btn btn-secondary primer-btn" href="08-industry-primer.pptx">⬇ PPTX</a>
                <a class="btn btn-watch primer-btn" href="08-industry-primer.mp4" target="_blank" rel="noopener">▶ Watch</a>
              </div>
              <div class="primer-meta">
                <span><strong>24</strong> slides</span><span class="primer-dot">·</span>
                <span><strong>~14</strong> min read</span><span class="primer-dot">·</span>
                <span>HSO-branded · brand placeholder until productization</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="primer-pullquotes">
              <blockquote class="primer-quote">
                <p>"It's not unusual for them to get 200 pages of PDF statements and a check of $4 million."</p>
                <cite>— Jim B · on a typical month-end carrier statement</cite>
              </blockquote>
              <blockquote class="primer-quote">
                <p>"This is where they have 50 people in AP, going through these statements."</p>
                <cite>— Jim B · on why the back-office is the buying trigger</cite>
              </blockquote>
              <blockquote class="primer-quote">
                <p>"The allegiance is to that agent, not to the company. If a producer leaves, their clients go with them."</p>
                <cite>— Jim B · on why producer retention rules everything</cite>
              </blockquote>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- ── Stage 2: Retirement & Wealth Primer ── -->
        <div class="primer-stage" data-stage-title="Retirement &amp; Wealth Primer">
          <div class="primer-inner">
            <div class="primer-content">
              <div class="section-eyebrow primer-eyebrow"><span style="color: var(--yellow);">★</span> Stage 2 · Adjacent vertical</div>
              <h2>Retirement &amp; Wealth <span class="accent">Primer</span></h2>
              <p class="section-lede">Insurance brokerage is the product's core market — but the same platform plays in retirement-plan advisory and private-wealth management. Same producer-loyalty dynamics, same commission complexity, same M&amp;A pressure, different regulators.</p>
              <p style="color: var(--slate); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65; margin-bottom: 32px;">Read this when sizing the broader TAM, scoping deals with a wealth or retirement arm, or briefing an audience whose practice spans both worlds. Four modules — the industry, the regulators, the trends, the outlook.</p>
              <div class="primer-actions">
                <a class="btn btn-primary primer-btn" href="hubintl-03-rpw.html">Start with RPW →</a>
                <a class="btn btn-secondary primer-btn" href="hubintl-03-rpw.pptx">⬇ PPTX</a>
                <a class="btn btn-watch primer-btn" href="hubintl-03-rpw.mp4" target="_blank" rel="noopener">▶ Watch</a>
              </div>
              <div class="primer-meta">
                <span><strong>4</strong> modules</span><span class="primer-dot">·</span>
                <span><strong>~40</strong> min total</span><span class="primer-dot">·</span>
                <span>Industry context · vertical-adjacent</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="module-mini-grid">
              <div class="module-mini">
                <h4>RPW · Retirement Plan &amp; Wealth</h4>
                <p>How retirement-plan advisory and private wealth work as a connected practice.</p>
                <div class="module-mini-links">
                  <a class="mm-view" href="hubintl-03-rpw.html">View</a>
                  <a class="mm-watch" href="hubintl-03-rpw.mp4" target="_blank" rel="noopener">▶ Watch</a>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="module-mini">
                <h4>RPA Industry Landscape</h4>
                <p>Retirement Plan Advisor market structure, players, and the consolidation wave.</p>
                <div class="module-mini-links">
                  <a class="mm-view" href="hubintl-04-rpa-industry.html">View</a>
                  <a class="mm-watch" href="hubintl-04-rpa-industry.mp4" target="_blank" rel="noopener">▶ Watch</a>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="module-mini">
                <h4>Regulatory Landscape</h4>
                <p>ERISA, fiduciary duty, SEC reporting — the rules that shape the back-office.</p>
                <div class="module-mini-links">
                  <a class="mm-view" href="hubintl-05-regulatory.html">View</a>
                  <a class="mm-watch" href="hubintl-05-regulatory.mp4" target="_blank" rel="noopener">▶ Watch</a>
                </div>
