        <!-- ── Stage 3: Customer · HUB International Primer ── -->
        <div class="primer-stage" data-stage-title="Customer: HUB International Primer">
          <div class="primer-inner">
            <div class="primer-content">
              <div class="section-eyebrow primer-eyebrow"><span style="color: var(--yellow);">★</span> Stage 3 · Customer-specific</div>
              <h2>Customer: HUB International <span class="accent">Primer</span></h2>
              <p class="section-lede">Now apply industry context to a specific customer. HUB International is the world's largest privately-held insurance brokerage — a fast-growing roll-up with 600+ acquired agencies, a sophisticated wealth/retirement arm, and exactly the back-office pains the platform was built to solve.</p>
              <p style="color: var(--slate); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65; margin-bottom: 32px;">Read this before any HUB engagement. Six modules covering the customer's history, business model, lines of business, and the regulatory / market forces shaping their next five years.</p>
              <div class="primer-actions">
                <a class="btn btn-primary primer-btn" href="hubintl-primer.html">Open the HUB primer →</a>
